MODULE: CrashDropsIntent
TARGET: DurableMove
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: restart forgets a persisted move phase
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, map, version, phase, source, destination, expected,
                   token, redirect, owner, moves, route, overwritten>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase' = [l \in Aliases |-> "idle"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, map, version, source, destination, expected,
                   token, redirect, owner, moves, route, overwritten>>
--- END
